---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Runs browser component tests through wasm-bindgen-test

Usage: leptoskit test web [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --package <PACKAGE>
          Cargo package containing browser tests
          
          [default: leptos_testing_library]

      --browser <BROWSER>
          Browser driver to use

          Possible values:
          - chrome:  Chrome via chromedriver
          - firefox: Firefox via geckodriver
          
          [default: chrome]

      --timeout <TIMEOUT>
          Maximum build and test duration
          
          [default: 600]

      --artifacts <ARTIFACTS>
          Parent directory for a unique run's artifacts
          
          [default: target/leptoskit-tests]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version
